# Poised Practitioner: "Flurry - Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Scry 1."
# Turn 3: the first spell (Ornithopter) does nothing; the second (Memnite) puts one counter and scries (the Plains on top goes to
# the bottom); the third (Mox Sapphire) does not trigger again, so the counter stays one and the library is unchanged.

